mod:escape_root_lost;
// DEF-639 (LOW, landing 177d2b4, row 7, Tue 2026-11-10): `oa64`'s address retyped through `any->` sixty-odd times is taken to point
// into any `List` under `h1`, so its making road (`@h1` into `p1`, the call that stores it) is refused beside the true 002 and 007.
// A PLACE THE ESCAPE WALK CAN'T ROOT IS REFUSED, NOT PASSED (DEF-430's escape-walk store face, with DEF-386/DEF-387's store face;
// landing 177d2b4, row 4). `esc_place_root` walks a place's casts and dereferences 64 hops and answered `exhausted` at its end, and
// `root_symbol` read that, and a root that is no name, as "no root": `push_view_ref_at` recorded nothing, so a callee that kept the
// address held no ref and `refuse_view_escape_into` was never asked, and `push_frame_root` asked no holder-scope question. A block-local's
// address kept past its block read freed heap after it (236 at -O0 and -O2, 97 under the freed-heap detector), on main and the base.
// Alpha, 64 or more casts and dereferences: the walk's end refuses (BORROW-007) at the store face (`ph64`, `ph64_x`, `pm_64`), the
// direct assignment (`asg_64`), a call's result (`rc64`), a `$$m` claim (`ph64_m`, where the claim's own BORROW-014 is false), and a
// view then a write of its root (`gv65`, alias's walk ran out too). Beta, an address taken at the call whose place's root is no name
// (`@(<-(@h1))`, `@(<-(raw idh(@h1)))`, the receiver `(<-(oh ??! E5))`): BORROW-009 (`pu1`, `pu1_x`, `pa1_x`, `pr1_x`, under a cast
// `pbu_k`). A `$$` claim of such a place is BORROW-014's alone (`pba_m`), and a pointer view handed by value keeps its own reports
// (`pv_f`). Each module is one cell; a cell's `main` stands here as `cell_main_<cell>`. The controls are in `escape_root_lost_ok.npk`.
// Casts outside the address (`keepself2(<N casts of @(...)>, @hd)`): beta's `ob64` is the helper's 009 after its 64-cast peel; `ob65` is the
// peel's own end, the escape walk's BORROW-007 at the argument's outermost cast; `oa64`, a named root under 64 such casts, is that 007 (the
// depth) beside the store face's BORROW-002 at the holder (the scope): two mistakes, two reports.
error:E5;
